Package: whatever2sbom
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: Michael Hansonis <whatever2sbom@teeque.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/teeque87/whatever2sbom
Description: Generate a rich SBOM for whatever you throw at it
 whatever2sbom generates a validated CycloneDX SBOM from a system or
 project. It is installed into a self-contained virtual environment
 under /opt/whatever2sbom so it does not interfere with the host's
 system Python or any other installed packages.
